From 012cd792f4561a6aad470ac250cb12970bac34ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:00:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] filemanager: Russian translation of the new strings

The strings of the previous patch in a separate catalog
po/ru/filemanager-ext.po: it is built into the same package
luci-i18n-filemanager-ru as filemanager.ru.lmo, and LuCI loads every
*.ru.lmo. The translations of filemanager.po are left as they are; the
strings it or luci-base translate already are not repeated.

Requires: 002-touch-screens-and-file-operations
---
 po/ru/filemanager-ext.po | 485 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 485 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 po/ru/filemanager-ext.po

diff --git a/po/ru/filemanager-ext.po b/po/ru/filemanager-ext.po
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d34b642
--- /dev/null
+++ b/po/ru/filemanager-ext.po
@@ -0,0 +1,485 @@
+msgid ""
